                           Error code: 401 - {'error': {'message': 'Incorrect API key provided: sk-not-a*****-key. You can 

2. A model that does not exist
  NotFoundError            wrong model name
                           Error code: 404 - {'error': {'message': 'The model `gpt-4o-tubro` does not exist or you do not h

3. A parameter this model does not accept
  BadRequestError          temperature on a reasoning model
