5. A message list the API cannot read
  BadRequestError          malformed messages
                           Error code: 400 - {'error': {'message': "Invalid value: 'narrator'. Supported values are: 'syste

6. A timeout you set too low
  APITimeoutError          timeout
                           Request timed out.

7. Too many requests, too fast
  RateLimitError           the one you cannot reliably trigger on purpose
                          and the one you will see most. Chapter 3 is the answer:
                          back off, add jitter, and honour Retry-After.
